{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52289","headline":"诗（幷序） 五十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 五十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一身元本别（张、项校作「利」），四大聚会同。\n直似风吹火，还如火逐风。\n火强火（项校「风」）炽疾，风[疾]（即）火[愈]（逾）烘。\n火风俱气尽，星散总成空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52289.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52289","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}